Local Voice bundles a Python runtime and its installed dependencies under
/usr/lib/local-voice/.bundle-venv. Their distribution metadata and license files
are included alongside the installed packages in site-packages. Review those
notices before redistribution. Optional Kokoro/Piper weights and the English
spaCy model wheel are not part of this package; users acquire them explicitly.
The Omarchy panel is installed under /usr/share/local-voice and is not enabled
by package installation.
